    skos:definition "In X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy factor which characterizes the intensity distribution, \\(L(\\gamma)\\), of photoelectrons ejected by X-rays from isolated atoms at an angle \\(\\gamma\\) from the incident X-ray direction. In the dipole approximation, \\(L(\\gamma) = 1 + ½\\beta [3(\\sin^{2}\\gamma)/2-1]\\)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme goldbook: ;
    skos:prefLabel "asymmetry parameter"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf goldbook: ;
